   Group Key: d.grp
   ->  Gather
         Workers Planned: 2
         ->  Parallel Custom Scan (LionCount)
               Partitions: lion_gj_f1_a_old, lion_gj_f1_a_new, lion_gj_f1_b
               Lion Indexes: (fk = d.pk), (tags && '{u2}'::text[])
               Implied by Partition Bounds: (kind = ANY ('{a,b}'::text[]))
               Join Type: Semi
               Join Key Lookups: in index order
               ->  (the dimension's plan: a join)
(11 rows)

